Included modules: hi_sam, image_encoder, mask_decoder, prompt_encoder,
modal_aligner, transformer, common. Training, datasets, EfficientSAM and
checkpoint pickle loading are not included.

Local change: inference-only image-encoder blocks call attention and MLP
directly rather than activation checkpointing. Training retains upstream
checkpoint calls with use_reentrant=False. No global Torch monkeypatch is used.
